Z||000030||Raydar||12-17-2001||02:04 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cookie4b.jpg">  <P>This is Cookie. She's half Boxer, half ramblin' man. <BR>We've only had her for two weeks. She had her first vet visit, last week. The vet said that she is younger than we thought. 12 1/2 weeks, now. Should be around 40 lbs., full grown. She's already discovered that she can jump right over the security gate that we bought to keep her off the carpet.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR>She was a pound puppy and very timid when we brought her home, but she's rapidly beginning to feel like one of the family, and act like a *complete* clown.  <P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||1
